	.string "等你攒够对战点数，\p"
	.string "请再来。$"

BattleFrontier_ExchangeServiceCorner_Text_WishIHadAllDolls: @ 825FF5D
	.string "哦，它们真不错！\n"
	.string "真希望我也能拿到！\p"
	.string "可爱的靠垫！\n"
	.string "大毛绒玩偶！\p"
	.string "小毛绒玩偶！\n"
	.string "真希望我全都有！$"

BattleFrontier_ExchangeServiceCorner_Text_GetYouAnythingYouWant: @ 825FFD0
	.string "交给你妈妈吧！\n"
	.string "只要你想要，宝贝，\p"
	.string "我什么都去给你弄来！$"

BattleFrontier_ExchangeServiceCorner_Text_ItemsWillGetMonTougher: @ 826002E
	.string "要是我能弄到这里的道具，\n"
	.string "我的宝可梦就会变强。\p"
	.string "一定会的！\n"
	.string "毫无疑问！$"

BattleFrontier_ExchangeServiceCorner_Text_GoGetYourOwnDoll: @ 8260099
	.string "哈？\n"
	.string "你在瞪什么眼？\p"
	.string "我不喜欢你那样盯着我的\n"
	.string "毛绒玩偶。\p"
	.string "想要就自己去弄一个！\n"
	.string "对吧，迷唇娃？$"

BattleFrontier_ExchangeServiceCorner_Text_MoreBattlePointsForRecord: @ 826012D
	.string "你知道吗？\n"
	.string "只要你在任何一座对战设施\p"
	.string "刷新记录，他们给你的对战点数\n"
	.string "就会越来越多。$"

